Basis: the registration as quoted in #8 (experiment-repo 98555e1, amendment 1 at 907e77c; I cannot read that repository, so commits and md5s are taken as stated, not checked), plan v2.13 as quoted, and `sacct` on Ibex (checked 2026-10-18 06:20 UTC). Nothing was trained.

